# slurm job logs, all of them.  Every file here is job output: the GPU training
# logs run 80 KB - 700 KB apiece (tqdm writes a progress bar per step) and the
# CPU pipeline logs are small but equally reproducible -- rerunning the job that
# wrote one is the way to get it back.  Kept on disk, out of the repo.
data/logs/
